; ASK.SCR - the questions PasTinyAsm asks.  You may change them.
; do: words that start a sentence taken as it is; other replies are text.
do beep play flash clear wait stop sound hide print
kind adventure game story maze quest
see What does the player see first?
keys Which keys can they press now?  (Enter if none)
press What happens when they press %?
stop Does the game stop there?  (yes or no)
other And for any other key?  (Enter for nothing)
kind menu chooser
see What does the menu show?
keys Which keys choose something?  (Enter if none)
press What does % do?
stop Does the program end after that?  (yes or no)
other And for any other key?  (Enter for nothing)
